    "latencyTargetMs": 40,
    "costBudget": 4048
  },
  "explanation": [
    "Agents batch and compress logs; collectors write them to a durable stream so a slow index never backs up services.",
    "Index only recent logs (hot tier) for search, and keep everything in object storage (cold tier) with lifecycle rules.",
    "Sample noisy debug logs at the source; it's the cheapest way to cut cost."
  ]
